Subject: [PATCH] TEST-ONLY: Squash of dma-heap API patches

This squashed of the following FROMLIST that are in MTEE ToT but also
used in the camera driver.

Remove this squash once the following patches are in the v6.1 branch or has a
copy in the camera HAL ToT.

dma-buf: heaps: Deduplicate docs and adopt common format
https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/linux-mediatek/patch/20231106120423.23364-6-yunfei.dong@mediatek.com/

dma-heap: Add proper kref handling on dma-buf heaps
https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/linux-mediatek/patch/20231106120423.23364-7-yunfei.dong@mediatek.com/

dma-heap: Provide accessors so that in-kernel drivers can allocate dmabufs from specific heaps
https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/linux-mediatek/patch/20231106120423.23364-8-yunfei.dong@mediatek.com/

